{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB 59周年台慶將向一班幕後功臣致敬，當中由效力長達55年的汪明荃（阿姐）領軍，向梳化服同事致敬的環節，阿姐竟能逐一說出所有同事的名字及其專長，驚人記憶力震撼全場！片段中阿姐細數多年合作點滴，場面溫馨感人，究竟她與這班幕後功臣有何不為人知的深厚情誼？\n</p>\n<h2>阿姐領軍致敬 逐一細數梳化服同事名字專長</h2>\n<p>在為梳化服同事致敬的特備影片中，由汪明荃領軍，分享與一眾老中青同事的難忘回憶。最令人驚艷的是，阿姐不但能準確說出在場每一位梳化服同事的名字，甚至連各人的專長、以及過去曾合作過的經典造型，都能鉅細無遺地一一道出。要知道阿姐效力TVB期間，經典角色造型多達80個，能記下背後團隊每個人的細節，足見其非凡的記憶力與對工作夥伴的尊重。言談間，阿姐自然流露了與眾人多年來建立的深厚合作情誼，場面相當感人。</p>\n<h2>效力TVB 55年創80經典造型 阿姐視幕後為戰友</h2>\n<p>今次致敬環節是為配合TVB 59周年台慶口號「TVB 與你行得更近，走得更遠」，向一班默默耕耘的幕後英雄致謝。當中，效力長達55年的阿姐汪明荃，絕對是見證電視台成長的最佳人選。她將自己超過80個經典造型的功勞，歸於一班心靈手巧的梳化服同事。阿姐在片段中視這班幕後人員為「戰友」，能鉅細無遺地說出合作細節，正正反映了她對每位工作夥伴的重視與感謝。除了阿姐，視帝譚俊彥、視后龔嘉欣及一眾藝人亦會以不同形式，向武指、攝製隊及舞台設計等團隊致敬。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚真Respect：「呢啲先係真正嘅阿姐！」</h2>\n<p>致敬片段的預告一出，隨即引來網民熱烈討論，大批觀眾對阿姐的專業態度及與幕後團隊的深厚感情表示佩服。網民紛紛留言大讚：「哇！做咗55年，仲記得晒所有人個名，真係好犀利！」、「呢啲先係真正嘅阿姐，尊重每一個崗位嘅同事。」、「好感動，睇到眼濕濕，台前幕後都係一家人。」、「唔係個個大星都做到，阿姐真係值得尊敬！」、「期待台慶睇足本版，想睇下阿姐講啲咩造型！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_6871062956afd2f213c9fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_6871062956afd2f213c9fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_18765952116afd2f0709ffe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_18765952116afd2f0709ffe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_4260375116afd2f27148e2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_4260375116afd2f27148e2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_12908620526afd2f2b9b17d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_12908620526afd2f2b9b17d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_15919401446afd2f2f7143e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_15919401446afd2f2f7143e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_1101722426afd2f33a9b8e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_1101722426afd2f33a9b8e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_17669612656afd2f38d0650.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_17669612656afd2f38d0650.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.101930+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1087,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:54:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:38:13.915162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:47.211307+00:00","content_hash":"baf6ba0c2c33f375812b1c94ed246ad5acb2d07342ec8d60f117c578ecbd511b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}